    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "One readily checks that all cohomologies introduced above are compatible with direct sums, vanish on squares and are one-dimensional on dots. Thus, as soon as a cohomology allows to reconstruct the information on the position of the dots, e.g. Dolbeault cohomology, or de Rham cohomology"
